<name>Fifth Water · parking and hiking</name>
<description>Community-mapped geometry, not a surveyed GPS track or a statement of legal/current access. Parking signs and closures take precedence. © OpenStreetMap contributors; ODbL 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright Retrieved 2026-10-19</description>
<Placemark><name>A · Three Forks parking</name><description>Main parking area mapped by OpenStreetMap. Very small; park only in a designated space. Confirm current fees, signs and road access. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/508214150</description><Point><coordinates>-111.35478983846154,40.08454102307692</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>B · Rays Valley west-side parking</name><description>Mapped parking at the Fifth Water / Rays Valley trailhead. Alternate approach, not overflow next to Three Forks. Verify signs and road access. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/84121702</description><Point><coordinates>-111.2910747,40.1056463</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>C · Rays Valley east-side parking</name><description>Second OSM-mapped parking point beside Rays Valley Road. Use only if currently designated; confirm safe road crossing to the west-side trail. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/84121705</description><Point><coordinates>-111.2905183,40.1059653</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Fifth Water pools area</name><description>Approximate lower pools area, not a designated entry point. Water-quality caution: check Utah DEQ before deciding to soak. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1115756925</description><Point><coordinates>-111.3186115875,40.082981512500005</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mapped pullout #6</name><description>OSM-mapped parking candidate, not field-verified. Only use if current signs designate parking. Road walking to Three Forks adds distance; no separate hiking shortcut is shown. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1428110696</description><Point><coordinates>-111.35783883636364,40.084217654545455</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mapped pullout #7</name><description>OSM-mapped parking candidate, not field-verified. Only use if current signs designate parking. Road walking to Three Forks adds distance; no separate hiking shortcut is shown. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1428110702</description><Point><coordinates>-111.34928173846154,40.08815611538462</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mapped pullout #8</name><description>OSM-mapped parking candidate, not field-verified. Only use if current signs designate parking. Road walking to Three Forks adds distance; no separate hiking shortcut is shown. Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1428110703</description><Point><coordinates>-111.3479670625,40.089584175</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
